    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/913cd50de05a14d1cbdda344f6cc6327.webp?t=1749477145\" /></span><br><strong>Hamster Clicker is a clicker game about collecting hamsters! Every 3 and 18 hours, you get dropped a chest with hamsters!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/e1d9a7ccad60de33e5cd3beb72bc32e7.webp?t=1749477145\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/5900067a06de4c13a4b81b736fb542b0.poster.avif?t=1749477145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/5900067a06de4c13a4b81b736fb542b0.webm?t=1749477145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/5900067a06de4c13a4b81b736fb542b0.mp4?t=1749477145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/268f099b40b386a9fab5e1c9eb93e6d3.webp?t=1749477145\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/eeeb550971c03ea127b124d2fbf31db8.poster.avif?t=1749477145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/eeeb550971c03ea127b124d2fbf31db8.webm?t=1749477145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/eeeb550971c03ea127b124d2fbf31db8.mp4?t=1749477145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Details</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You will get 1 common chest drop every <strong>3 hours</strong> and 1 rare chest every <strong>18 hours</strong><br></li><li>You can freely <strong>sell chests</strong> on community market, <strong>trade</strong> them or<strong> open in game</strong>. Most of them are <strong>free</strong> to open, but <strong>rarest</strong> one requires <strong>keys</strong> which you can get from items shop or buying DLC<br></li><li>You can <strong>trade up</strong> 9 items of the same rarity for 1 with increased rarity<br></li><li>You can use hamsters in game as models<br></li><li>Game has leaderboards for best collectors with maximum amount of hamsters<br></li><li>You can easily get achievements just for clicking</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/913cd50de05a14d1cbdda344f6cc6327.webp?t=1749477145\" /></span><br><strong>Hamster Clicker is a clicker game about collecting hamsters! Every 3 and 18 hours, you get dropped a chest with hamsters!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/e1d9a7ccad60de33e5cd3beb72bc32e7.webp?t=1749477145\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/5900067a06de4c13a4b81b736fb542b0.poster.avif?t=1749477145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/5900067a06de4c13a4b81b736fb542b0.webm?t=1749477145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/5900067a06de4c13a4b81b736fb542b0.mp4?t=1749477145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/268f099b40b386a9fab5e1c9eb93e6d3.webp?t=1749477145\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/eeeb550971c03ea127b124d2fbf31db8.poster.avif?t=1749477145\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/eeeb550971c03ea127b124d2fbf31db8.webm?t=1749477145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376170/extras/eeeb550971c03ea127b124d2fbf31db8.mp4?t=1749477145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Details</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You will get 1 common chest drop every <strong>3 hours</strong> and 1 rare chest every <strong>18 hours</strong><br></li><li>You can freely <strong>sell chests</strong> on community market, <strong>trade</strong> them or<strong> open in game</strong>. Most of them are <strong>free</strong> to open, but <strong>rarest</strong> one requires <strong>keys</strong> which you can get from items shop or buying DLC<br></li><li>You can <strong>trade up</strong> 9 items of the same rarity for 1 with increased rarity<br></li><li>You can use hamsters in game as models<br></li><li>Game has leaderboards for best collectors with maximum amount of hamsters<br></li><li>You can easily get achievements just for clicking</li></ul>",
